,"shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YdxHpdqppWRVo0xgf5ojJg","review_id":"pqsOzUwgnUBai31F-neO3Q","date":"2017-09-24T10:55:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9272750616073608,"text_excerpt":"This place has amazing food and fun, colorful regulars. I really love Ray, his wife and his daughter. Unlike a lot of small seafood counters in New Orleans, you can opt for blackened rather than battered and deep fried. It furniture is different. The prices are great. You really should check it out on a weekend night."},{"business_id":"YdxHpdqppWRVo0xgf5ojJg","review_id":"C3h-FnDeQI37s5VtLxxbBQ","date":"2018-03-11T20:06:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9166790843009949,"text_excerpt":"Don't let the neighborhood, building or size of the inside fool you. The food here was amazing! I ordered the Creole Soul Catfish Treme dish & my husband had the New Orleans Favorite Fried Catfish and Red Beans & Rice. I was disappointed in the drink selections. On the day I visited the only options were water, coke & sprite. They also have some soul food dish specials that can only be ordered on certain days. We were very satified with the food & service"},{"business_id":"YdxHpdqppWRVo0xgf5ojJg","review_id":"Ldk1_lTjrmvM1FjFoOPPpQ","date":"2017-05-21T21:42:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9161938428878784,"text_excerpt":"Went there on my last visit in April. Couldn't decide what to get so I got several things. Catfish, BBQ Ribs, Mac and Cheese and Red Beans and Rice and it was all good. Staff was very friendly. Great experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YdxHpdqppWRVo0xgf5ojJg","photo_id":"uhy0x4sewBP4kmCQiXWh2A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uhy0x4sewBP4kmCQiXWh2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
